text.section:
Control or possession of certain collateral. Except as otherwise provided in § 8.9A-315 (c) and (d) for proceeds:

a security interest in a deposit account may be perfected only by control under § 8.9A-314;


except as otherwise provided in § 8.9A-308 (d), a security interest in a letter-of-credit right may be perfected only by control under § 8.9A-314;


a security interest in tangible money may be perfected only by the secured party's taking possession under § 8.9A-313; and


a security interest in electronic money may be perfected only by control under § 8.9A-314.
